{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"You notice that I do not write about Paris with such fire and enthusiasm as I did from Vienna, and that you have communicated much to the friends; that may be so, but everything I write is too fleeting to be capable of much communication. You must take into account that my ill health has caused me to lose much time, and then that everything is so enormously vast and sprawling that one must be externally quite vigorous to encompass more, and must stay here longer to come into deeper contacts and penetrations. It is a most interesting ground, but a few weeks are only enough to get out of the stupor and into the habit of all the brilliant and manifold things. Today, for example, we drove to an abattoir, i.e., a slaughterhouse—in which city in the world would I drive to a slaughterhouse?—but this is one of the curiosities that Paris owes to Napoleon, as it does to a hundred other great things. Then we were on the Montmartre, where one overlooks the wealth of houses in Paris and the splendid, fertile, lively surroundings; also in the Palace of the Chamber of Deputies. We saw the Stock Exchange, still laid out by Napoleon, beforehand, what a temple! At half past six o’clock I dined with Cousin and Fauriel (the editor of the Greek songs, which have also been translated into German). A few days ago we dined together with Mignet, Thiers, Mustoxidis, Fauriel, and so on; in short, one must be in Paris for half a year to become more familiar with everything for which one takes a deeper interest, and, as said, through habit to lose all interest in what is striking and worth seeing for the first period. Cousin has often laughed at me when I saw and found remarkable what the conscience of a traveler and the Manual of the Foreigner prescribed to see."}}],"created":1795080543,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":389,"prompt_tokens":572,"total_tokens":961,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-BU03vXVnlH0T3WUibJvseIQE8XxrUPXJ","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":572,"prompt_ms":791.881,"prompt_per_token_ms":1.3844073426573427,"prompt_per_second":722.3307542421146,"predicted_n":389,"predicted_ms":9409.509,"predicted_per_token_ms":24.251311855670103,"predicted_per_second":41.23488271279617}}